{"id":"b24f25338d17d661","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-q-c.md","title":"Q(C)复杂性类","display":"df-q-c — Q(C)复杂性类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-q-c","aliases":["29-df-q-c"],"display":"df-q-c — Q(C)复杂性类","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]","[[29-df-query]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 2.5, Eq.(2.6), p.26, DjVu scan 41","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-q-c"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-q-c</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-q-c — Q(C)复杂性类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17c1d364fcf4fba1\" href=\"?note=17c1d364fcf4fba1\" title=\"29-df-query\">29-df-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 2.5, Eq.(2.6), p.26, DjVu scan 41"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇（允许常量、不含函数），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 遍历下面定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span>。输入、输出均为有序对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(A,L)=A\">\\(\\pi_1(A,L)=A\\)</span> 为第一坐标投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\sigma,\\mathfrak O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\sigma,\\mathfrak O_\\tau\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a> 的结构同构；多项式系数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为二进制判定语言的复杂性类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。位图使用下式固定的二进制编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_Q\">\\(\\operatorname{code}_Q\\)</span>，不留任意可计算编码参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma,\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma,\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w[i]\">\\(w[i]\\)</span> 是字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 从零开始的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 位。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a> 的有序输入结构类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>字符串相邻书写表示串接；末尾 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 是一位字符串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\\)</span>；未满足编码结构的二进制串不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_Q(i)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}:i&lt;2^\\ell\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{nb}_Q(i)\\coloneqq\\left(\\left\\lfloor i/2^{\\ell_Q(i)-1-j}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right)_{0\\leq j&lt;\\ell_Q(i)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_Q(i)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}:i&lt;2^\\ell\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{nb}_Q(i)\\coloneqq\\left(\\left\\lfloor i/2^{\\ell_Q(i)-1-j}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right)_{0\\leq j&lt;\\ell_Q(i)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_Q(w,i,b)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}0w\\,1^{\\ell_Q(i)}0\\operatorname{nb}_Q(i)b\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad|\\operatorname{code}_Q(w,i,b)|=2|w|+2\\ell_Q(i)+3.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_Q(w,i,b)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}0w\\,1^{\\ell_Q(i)}0\\operatorname{nb}_Q(i)b\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad|\\operatorname{code}_Q(w,i,b)|=2|w|+2\\ell_Q(i)+3.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\operatorname{card}(|\\pi_1(I(U))|)\\leq p(\\operatorname{card}(|\\pi_1(U)|))\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(\\mathfrak O_\\sigma(U)\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\sigma(V)\\to\\mathfrak O_\\tau(I(U))\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\tau(I(V)))\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\operatorname{card}(|\\pi_1(I(U))|)\\leq p(\\operatorname{card}(|\\pi_1(U)|))\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(\\mathfrak O_\\sigma(U)\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\sigma(V)\\to\\mathfrak O_\\tau(I(U))\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\tau(I(V)))\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{code}_Q(\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma(A),i,b)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma],\\ 0\\leq i&lt;|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(I(A))|,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ \\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(I(A))[i]=b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{code}_Q(\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma(A),i,b)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma],\\ 0\\leq i&lt;|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(I(A))|,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ \\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(I(A))[i]=b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{I\\in\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\in C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{I\\in\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\in C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.5 与式 (2.6)，印刷页 26，扫描页 41。修正原来的不存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}\\)</span> 接口及把整数 BIT 谓词当作字符串取位函数的签名错误。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(C)\">\\(Q(C)\\)</span> 在本条用于计算类的非布尔查询扩张，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a> 的逻辑布尔查询记号按参数类型区分。</p>\n<p>本轮为本条有序输入重构显式的 OrdQuery 接口：原来的 Query[σ,τ] 只接收结构，不接收(A,L)对，故不能仅凭引用该原子补足类型。多项式大小及保持有序同构条件现在都在 Assertion 中；有序对经 O 映射后才应用结构同构，bin 的有序对重载与本条一致。本条是固定输入/输出词汇的非布尔查询分支；原书无参数的 Q(C) 还并入布尔查询C，不在这里把输出结构类与布尔语言类混作一个类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-isomorphism]]","embed":f