29-df-fo-q-fo]] 的逻辑布尔查询记号按参数类型区分。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1(A,L)=A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak O_\\sigma,\\mathfrak O_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N[X]","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma,\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"w[i]","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_Q(i)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}:i<2^\\ell\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{nb}_Q(i)\\coloneqq\\left(\\left\\lfloor i/2^{\\ell_Q(i)-1-j}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right)_{0\\leq j<\\ell_Q(i)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}_Q(w,i,b)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}0w\\,1^{\\ell_Q(i)}0\\operatorname{nb}_Q(i)b\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad|\\operatorname{code}_Q(w,i,b)|=2|w|+2\\ell_Q(i)+3.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\operatorname{card}(|\\pi_1(I(U))|)\\leq p(\\operatorname{card}(|\\pi_1(U)|))\\\\&\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(\\mathfrak O_\\sigma(U)\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\sigma(V)\\to\\mathfrak O_\\tau(I(U))\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\tau(I(V)))\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{code}_Q(\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma(A),i,b)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma],\\ 0\\leq i<|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(I(A))|,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ \\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(I(A))[i]=b\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{I\\in\\mathrm{OrdQuery}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{BitGraph}_{\\sigma,\\tau}(I)\\in C\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"Q(C)","display":false}],"bytes":3788,"backlinks":[{"id":"2005f7c77a4cbc08","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 是多项式大小有界、保持有序结构同构的查询；$C$ 是二进制判定语言类。$Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-q-c]] 的逐位计算接口。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]、[[29-df-q-c]]、[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]] — 任意枚举编码、有序查询与类型正确的关系赋值"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-q-c]]"},{"id":"ef134b4589bf7f20","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-q-c|29-df-q-c]]"}],"outgoing":["b89b00b2e37a4ae5","3a603dc4f41b07de","17c1d364fcf4fba1","57d3a90cf94ef42e","4f651c8d1bdc9a58"]}